{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "http",
    "description": "",
    "license": {
      "name": ""
    },
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/chat/completion": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "chat"
        ],
        "summary": "Process an initial chat completion request",
        "description": "Initiates a new chat session and processes the first user message through the specified AI persona.\n\n**API Key Requirements:**\n- `super` keys: Must provide `persona_id` (e.g. `{\"persona\": {\"persona_id\": 42}}`)\n- `test` keys: Can provide `persona_id` or `alias` (e.g. `{\"persona\": {\"alias\": \"support\"}}`)\n- `prod` keys: Use `alias` or omit for default persona\n\n**Version Types:**\n- `active`: Production version (default for prod keys)\n- `next`: Development version (accessible to test/super keys)\n\n**Default Persona Behavior:**\nIf persona is omitted and API key has a default persona configured, that persona\nwill be used. Otherwise, returns 400 error.\n\n**max_tokens Override:**\nIf specified, overrides the persona's configured max_tokens setting for this\nrequest only. Must be within model's limits (typically 1-8000).\n\n**Session Creation:**\nA new chat session is automatically created. Use the returned `session_id` for\ncontinuation via `/api/chat/continuation` endpoint.\n\n**Response Types:**\n- Success: Returns `rg_response` with AI-generated content and token usage\n- Flagged: Returns `mod_response` if content moderation triggered",
        "operationId": "chat_completion",
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "Chat completion request with persona identifier and message. Requirements depend on API key type: 'super' keys require persona_id; 'test' keys require persona_id or alias; 'prod' keys accept optional alias. All key types support optional version_type ('active' or 'next').",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiChatCompletionRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Chat response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiChatCompletionResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "default": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "api_key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/chat/completion/stream": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "chat"
        ],
        "summary": "Process an initial chat completion request with streaming",
        "description": "Initiates a new chat session with Server-Sent Events (SSE) for token-by-token streaming.\nThe persona must support streaming mode.\n\nAuthentifcation by JWT Token or Api-Key\n\n**API Key Requirements:**\n- `super` keys: Must provide `persona_id` and optional version_type (e.g. `{\"persona\": {\"persona_id\": 42, \"version_type\": \"active\" }}`)\n- `test` keys: Can provide `persona_id` & `version_type` or `alias` (e.g. `{\"persona\": {\"alias\": \"support\"}}`)\n- `prod` keys: Use `alias` or omit for default persona\n\n**Version Types:**\n- `active`: Production version (default for prod keys)\n- `next`: Development version (accessible to test/super keys)\n\n**Server-Sent Events Format:**\nEach event is a JSON object with a `type` field:\n\n- `session_created`: `{\"type\": \"session_created\", \"session_id\": \"uuid\"}`\n- `token`: `{\"type\": \"token\", \"content\": \"text chunk\"}`\n- `done`: `{\"type\": \"done\", \"usage\": {...}, \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"}`\n- `error`: `{\"type\": \"error\", \"code\": \"internal\", \"message\": \"human-readable description\"}`\n\nAll errors (including validation, auth, and persona errors) are delivered as\n`error` events in the stream rather than HTTP status codes. The `code` field\nenables programmatic handling: `session_expired`, `auth_failed`, `unavailable`,\n`content_filtered`, `internal`.\n\n**Connection:** Uses SSE with keep-alive. Client should handle reconnection\nif connection drops before `done` event.\n\n",
        "operationId": "chat_completion_stream",
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "Chat completion request with persona identifier and message (same as /completion).",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiChatCompletionRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "SSE stream of chat events (errors delivered as stream events, not HTTP status codes)",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {}
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "api_key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/chat/continuation": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "chat"
        ],
        "summary": "Continues a chat session initiated using chat completion request",
        "operationId": "chat_continuation",
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "Chat completion request session_id and message.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiChatContinuationRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Chat response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiChatCompletionResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "No access to persona",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Persona or session not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Server error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "default": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "api_key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/chat/continuation/stream": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "chat"
        ],
        "summary": "Continues a chat session initiated using chat completion request with streaming",
        "description": "Continues a chat session with Server-Sent Events (SSE) for token-by-token streaming.\nThe persona must support streaming mode.\n\n**Server-Sent Events Format:**\nEach event is a JSON object with a `type` field:\n\n- `session_continued`: `{\"type\": \"session_continued\", \"session_id\": \"uuid\"}`\n- `token`: `{\"type\": \"token\", \"content\": \"text chunk\"}`\n- `done`: `{\"type\": \"done\", \"usage\": {...}, \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"}`\n- `error`: `{\"type\": \"error\", \"code\": \"session_expired\", \"message\": \"human-readable description\"}`\n\nAll errors (including session lookup, auth, and persona errors) are delivered as\n`error` events in the stream rather than HTTP status codes. The `code` field\nenables programmatic handling: `session_expired`, `auth_failed`, `unavailable`,\n`content_filtered`, `internal`.\n\n**Connection:** Uses SSE with keep-alive. Client should handle reconnection\nif connection drops before `done` event.",
        "operationId": "chat_continuation_stream",
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "Chat continuation request with session ID and message.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiChatContinuationRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "SSE stream of chat events (errors delivered as stream events, not HTTP status codes)",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {}
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "api_key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/chat/get_token": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "chat"
        ],
        "summary": "Get a JWT token for chat authentication",
        "description": "Authentification by  Api-Key\n\nValidates the API key and persona, then issues a JWT token that can be used\nfor subsequent chat requests. The token contains the user_id and /// **API Key Requirements:**\n- `super` keys: Must provide `persona_id` and optional version_type (e.g. `{\"persona\": {\"persona_id\": 42, \"version_type\": \"active\" }}`)\n- `test` keys: Can provide `persona_id` & `version_type` or `alias` (e.g. `{\"persona\": {\"alias\": \"support\"}}`)\n- `prod` keys: Use `alias` or omit for default persona\n\n**Version Types:**\n- `active`: Production version (default for prod keys)\n- `next`: Development version (accessible to test/super keys)\npersona version ID.",
        "operationId": "get_token",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiGetTokenRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Token generated",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiGetTokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Invalid API key or persona access",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Persona not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Server error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "default": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "api_key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "health"
        ],
        "summary": "Health check endpoint - monitors service health including database connectivity and billing queue",
        "description": "Returns HTTP 200 if all systems are operational (database connected, normal queue depth),\nor HTTP 503 if any component is unhealthy.\n\n**Response includes:**\n- Overall status (\"healthy\" or \"unhealthy\")\n- Database connectivity status\n- API version (from Cargo.toml)\n- Billing queue metrics (current depth, peak depth, drop rate percentage)\n\n**Security:** May be protected by UI API key if `security.health.require_apikey`\nis enabled in system configuration (defaults to true).",
        "operationId": "health_check",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Service is healthy - all systems operational",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Service is unhealthy - database or other critical system failure",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "ApiChatCompletionRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Chat completion request",
        "required": [
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "max_tokens": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32",
            "description": "Override max tokens for this request. Must be between 1 and model's maximum (typically 4000-8000)",
            "example": 1000,
            "maximum": 8000,
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "User message to process (1-8000 characters)",
            "example": "What are the business hours?",
            "maxLength": 8000,
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "persona": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "null"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatPersonaIdentifier",
                "description": "Persona identifier. Required for 'super' keys, optional for 'test'/'prod' keys (uses default if omitted)"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiChatCompletionResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "session_id"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "mod_response": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "null"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ModerationResult"
              }
            ]
          },
          "rg_response": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "null"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiChatRgResponse"
              }
            ]
          },
          "session_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiChatContinuationRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Chat continuation request\nContinue an existing session by adding a new user message",
        "required": [
          "session",
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "max_tokens": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32",
            "description": "Optional max tokens override"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "session": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiChatModResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "category"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "category": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiChatRgResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "response",
          "tokens_used"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "response": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "tokens_used": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiFinishReason": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Reason why the stream completed\n\nNormalized across all providers. Engine-specific finish reasons\nare mapped to these universal types.",
        "enum": [
          "stop",
          "tool_calls",
          "length",
          "error",
          "content_filter"
        ]
      },
      "ApiGetTokenRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "user_id"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "persona": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "type": "null"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatPersonaIdentifier"
              }
            ]
          },
          "user_id": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiGetTokenResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "token",
          "expires_at"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "expires_at": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "description": "Unix EPOCH Seconds timestamp"
          },
          "token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "A chat token valid for a specific Api-Key and Persona"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApiStreamEvent": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Session created - includes session_id for future continuation. This is the first event emitted.",
            "required": [
              "session_id",
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "session_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid",
                "description": "UUID of the created chat session"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "session_created"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "session_id",
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "session_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid",
                "description": "UUID of the continued chat session"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "session_continued"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Content token/chunk - partial response text. Multiple token events form the complete response.",
            "required": [
              "content",
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "content": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Text chunk to append to the response"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "token"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Stream completed successfully - includes final token usage and finish reason. This is the last event.",
            "required": [
              "usage",
              "finish_reason",
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "finish_reason": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiFinishReason",
                "description": "Reason why the stream finished"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "done"
                ]
              },
              "usage": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenUsage",
                "description": "Total token usage for this completion"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Error occurred during streaming - client should stop processing",
            "required": [
              "code",
              "message",
              "type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StreamErrorCode",
                "description": "Machine-parsable error classification"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Human-readable error message suitable for display to end users"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "error"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Events emitted during streaming response generation\n\nAll RG handlers that support streaming emit these standardized events.\nEngine-specific formats are converted to these universal types."
      },
      "BillingQueueStatus": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "depth",
          "peak",
          "drop_rate"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "depth": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Current queue depth",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "drop_rate": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "double",
            "description": "Drop rate percentage"
          },
          "peak": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Peak queue depth",
            "minimum": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatPersonaIdentifier": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "alias": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Persona alias (e.g., 'customer-support'). Used by test/prod API keys",
            "example": "customer-support"
          },
          "persona_id": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "int32",
            "description": "Numeric persona ID. Used by super/test API keys",
            "example": 42
          },
          "version_type": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Version type: 'active' (production) or 'next' (development). Defaults to 'active' for prod keys",
            "example": "active"
          }
        }
      },
      "EngineParamDefault": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "param_key",
          "param_type",
          "default_value",
          "is_required"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "default_value": {},
          "description": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "is_required": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "param_key": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "param_type": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "validation_rules": {}
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "error"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "HealthResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "status",
          "database",
          "version",
          "billing_queue"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "billing_queue": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BillingQueueStatus",
            "description": "Billing queue status"
          },
          "database": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Database connectivity status"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Overall status"
          },
          "version": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "API version"
          }
        }
      },
      "ModerationResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Result from moderation check",
        "required": [
          "flagged",
          "categories",
          "category_scores"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "categories": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Categories that were flagged (if any)",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "category_scores": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Optional detailed scores per category",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "number",
              "format": "float"
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "flagged": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Whether the content was flagged"
          }
        }
      },
      "PersonaParamInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "param_key",
          "param_type",
          "param_value",
          "default_value",
          "is_required"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "default_value": {},
          "description": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "is_required": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "param_key": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "param_type": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "param_value": {},
          "validation_rules": {}
        }
      },
      "StreamErrorCode": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Machine-parsable error codes for streaming error events.\n\nClients can match on these codes for programmatic error handling\n(e.g. retry logic, token refresh) without parsing message text.",
        "enum": [
          "session_expired",
          "auth_failed",
          "unavailable",
          "content_filtered",
          "internal"
        ]
      },
      "TokenUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "prompt_tokens",
          "completion_tokens",
          "total_tokens"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "completion_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "prompt_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "total_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
